Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the seal of Orikakos,\NI've just sealed the duel, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll be losing your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but it wouldn't be the first\Ntime that happened to you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No more tricks, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that seem like a trick to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let my brother out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea who you're messing with.\NSure I do. I'm messing with a greedy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,little punk who's just as pathetic as\Nhis old man What did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No one compares me to my\Nstepfather and gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a worthless snake like you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My family business has nothing\Nto do with you guess again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,your family business has everything\Nto do with me All right, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:01:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to represent every single person
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,whose life was ripped\Napart by your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to make sure you're never able\Nto step on anyone ever again. Get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear that speech every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Punch buggy green. No backsies. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a car around for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right, Yug?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you guys worried about what\NPegasus said on that videotape yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.39,0:02:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling it's\Nthe same biker gang that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,stole the Egyptian god cars\Nfrom my grandpa's shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If they found him, we could\Nbe walking into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get on with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gorlag in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.23,0:03:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And here's a little bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster just got stronger. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the Seal of Orichalcos?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it stays active on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,every one of my monsters gets\Na 500 attack point boost. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus my Gorlag gets another 500 points\Nfor every fire monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There are none. Oh, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think my Gorlag's made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Gorlag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his, Versago the Destroyer, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention my\NGorlag's other special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time he destroys one\Nof my opponent's monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that very same monster reappears\Non my side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this time, it becomes\Na creature of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And you remember what happens when a\Ncreature of fire is on the field, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My Gorlack gets even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster Seto loses\Nbecomes Alistair's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His old deck could turn against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've placed one card\Nface down, I'll end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This wacko has more skill than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But too bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got just the\Ncards to take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.89,0:04:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my virus combination\Ninfects his gore lag,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster he stole\Nfrom me will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then his life points will be wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime, so stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:05:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I summon Pitch Dark\NDragon in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, that's Crush Card, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had my eye on you\Nfor a long time, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know every pathetic\Ndetail of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Including your obvious\Ndual monster strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.53,0:05:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that you were\Nsuch a big fan of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So is that why you dragged\Nme all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanted my autograph, all\Nyou had to do was ask me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me sick, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You ruined my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, this is all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize you're holding a\Nbusted action figure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any idea what\Nthis thing means to me, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So you love your doll. How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Know why? Humor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be my brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll never see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your father took him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was seven years ago today,\Na day I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The tanks came back, but this\Ntime it was worse than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy wouldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not till they won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have that thing, Mikey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's just a toy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but soon the real Dynodude is going to\Nshow up and beat up all the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then what's taking him so long\Nto get here and save the day already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe in here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:06:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Dynadude hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She was captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I promise that\Nwon't happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon we'll find Mom. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But until then, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey, where are you, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They took him, they got my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikey, soon the real Dynatude will show\Nup. Don't worry, he's gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mikey, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after he was taken, I found\Nout who was really responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:07:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have done\Nthis without you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:07:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have done anything\Nto get Mikey back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair I know who took your\Nfamily away from you, my child
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you do as I say, you'll\Nsoon be reunited with them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I will?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a friend A friend who wants to see\Njustice served by helping you destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the man who created the very tanks your\Nenemies used to capture your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozaburo Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you run his evil empire,\Nso it's your fault too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to pay for your father's crime\Nby giving up your soul to feed the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our stepfather was a big jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't blame Seto for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew that Gozabora was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Seto took\Ncontrol of Kaiba Corp and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,changed it into a company\Nthat helps people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to you is not our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know? A lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not know this, but my brother\Nand I grew up without a family also!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now imagine what your life would be like\Nif you didn't have your brother either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A family spat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.65,0:09:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother won't push you around\Nanymore once I take away his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you own was\Npaid for by Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The clothes you wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The food you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:09:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That same money took my brother away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time to pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By giving me your soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.95,0:10:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a good point. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My stepfather was a snake, and what\Nhe did to your family was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And you deserve to be\Npaid for that. Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really care for the way you got me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,here by threatening to\Nput me out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't we continue this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're lucky enough to win,\Nmaybe I'll decide to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When I defeat you in this\Nduel, you will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Royal Decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as this card's in play, all other\Ntrap cards on the field are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need my crush card to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope my little trap card didn't\Nput a damper on your strategy, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Gorlag, attack his\Ndragon with Firestorm Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now try a taste of your own monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.79,0:11:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Versago the Destroyer, attack\Nhis life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're down to your last 400 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Gorlag's ability, the\Nmonster you just lost belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Only now, he's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to summon a pretty\Nstrong monster to stop him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have nothing to sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one card that can\Nhelp, but I need to draw it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll start this\Nround off by activating
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,a simple magic card\Nknown as Card of Demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me draw three cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's where things get complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate White Dragon Ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me play one of my favorite cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:12:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as I sacrifice a\Npowerful monster first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll send my mighty Blue-Eyes White\NDragon straight to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to summon\NPaladin of White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll use Monster Reborn to\Nbring back my Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.81,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Paladin, attack with Ionic Spear Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that one of your fire monsters is\Ngone, your Gorlag loses 500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon,\Ndestroy his Gorlag!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready for the fun to end just yet,\Nso I've got one more surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll finish things\Noff by trading in my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,paladin for another\Nblue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought I devastated\Nyou this turn, then just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst is ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one word for\Nyour moves: Predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your lame strategy\Ncoming from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.49,0:13:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then let's\Nsee you do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My pot of green.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me draw two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I activate another magic\Ncard called a Tonic's Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you have destroyed\Nboth of my dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to brush up on\Nyour dual monsters' cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A tonic's flame destroys every creature\Non the field that isn't a fire monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And as an added bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it allows me to bring my gorelag\Nback to the field in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate a magic\Ncard known as Fire Whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my fire whip, your\Nprecious blue eyes belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And they've been resurrected\Nas creatures of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dragons are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but last I checked, your\Ndragons were on my side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll use your favorite\Nmonsters to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you save perfect revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my newly acquired\Ndragons are also fire monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,my Gorlag gets a 1,000-point boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.33,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staring into the\Nface of three unstoppable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,creatures with a grand\Ntotal of 10,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But lucky for you, I can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:15:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the sacred seal of\NOrichalcos, when you lose your life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you lose your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll suffer just like I did\Nat the hands of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down to my last 400 life\Npoints and I'm out of moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a card in my\Ndeck that can save me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be hallucinating
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you have been chosen\Nto release the mighty Critias.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is remove the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about ready to\Nwake up from this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now join forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything to shut you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to play your card or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing things again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I never put this card in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And the picture looks exactly like\Nthe dragon I just dreamt about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this another one of\NAlistair's tricks? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I play Fang of Critias. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you call this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll merge my dragon with my\Ncrush card to create a new monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't fuse a\Ntrap card with a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like I just did, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise up, Doom Virus Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine are stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,True,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but Doom Virus Dragon has a special\Nability that automatically destroys
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster on the field whose\Nattack strength is 1,500 or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So all your monsters are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Doom Virus Dragon, attack\Nhis life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over. I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't beat me yet, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Contagion of Madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose 1,900 life points thanks\Nto your virus dragon's attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but you lose 950 thanks to my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back, and you'll pay\Nfor what your father did to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why'd we stop, man? Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.29,0:18:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd we stop at some\Nrun-down gas station?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the looks of this.
